MultiLingualTexts:
  - id: MLC_I1
    en-US: Start command
  - id: MLC_I2
    en-US: Stop command
  - id: MLC_O1
    en-US: First parallel coil
  - id: MLC_O2
    en-US: Second parallel coil
  - id: MLC_O3
    en-US: Third parallel coil, only without stop
  - id: MLC_O4
    en-US: Coil of the network with the open branch
  - id: MLC_O5
    en-US: Set by the open branch when stop is pressed during start
  - id: MLC_S1
    en-US: Number of cycles with start pressed
  - id: MLC_N1T
    en-US: Several coils in parallel
  - id: MLC_N2T
    en-US: Open branch from the main rung, not closed again
  - id: MLC_N3T
    en-US: Network ending in a box
